egolab.top playground — quick reference
=======================================

This is a throwaway container. No internet, no persistence, auto-killed after
about 10 minutes idle. Everything you do here is discarded on exit.

Project demos (type the command):
  sepotipai              Spotify-like queue/playlist manager, in C.
                         Type START first, then LIST / PLAY / QUEUE / HELP.
  burbir                 Twitter-like social app, in C. Every input needs a
                         trailing ";" — type just ";" at the folder prompt,
                         then DAFTAR; to register, KICAU; to post.
  htmlcheck <file.html>  Validate HTML with a Pushdown Automaton.
                         Samples live in /opt/labs/html-checker/test/.
  citra edge <img> <op>  Edge detection. op = sobel|prewitt|roberts|laplace|log.
                         Sample images in /opt/labs/citra-digital/samples/.

Browse the source of every project (read-only):
  ls /srv/projects
  ls /srv/projects/sepotipai/src

My CV:
  cat ~/cv.txt           plain-text version, right here
  the PDF                grab it over scp from the SSH menu (Download CV)

Web projects are hosted as their own subdomains — see the Projects section on
the site (https://egolab.top) for the live links.
